  "note": "Host: \"He says he stayed in Orem. Then ... says that they stayed in Salt Lake City.\" Clip: \"you said you spent the night in Orem.\" Neff's Orem statement was about himself, not the team; claim lacks host attribution.",
  "fix": {
   "claim": "The host says Blake Neff initially said he spent the night in Orem, UT, then revised the statement to Salt Lake City, where she says the Turning Point USA team stayed."
  }
 },
 {
  "claim": "C-3081",
